{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getaway Storm</strong>\u00a0is a simple fun arcade racing game that quickly turns into online multiplayer chaos with friends! Surviving for as long as you can is a team effort, since anyone getting wrecked is a game over for everyone. Let's see how fast you can go and how long you can last. \ud83d\ude0e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer with 1-5 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade handling/drifting physics that are just built different \ud83d\ude0e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio Drive mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 sus cars to unlock and drive \ud83d\ude33 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of car crashes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highscore and replay system with different categories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly and Daily online leaderboards</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1215950?t=1772958411","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1215950?t=1772958411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1215950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772958411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1215950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772958411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"